                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Using Blockchain To Improve Cross-Border Remittances. Roxe, a global open payment network, uses the
                  Blockchain to instantly transfer value via the Roxe Chain. The company claims that the chain can
                  also provide customizable KYC/AML solutions to financial institutions (FIs), as well as other users.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
