                  1.Login to access your Wallet.<br />
                  2.Click on the Send button to select the currency to be sent.<br />
                  3.Select "Blockchain Exchange" as the To address. This will automatically generate the Blockchain
                  Exchange address needed for this transaction.<br />
                  4.Enter the amount, and click Send.<br />

